{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file contains core implementation functions for DNS response parsing, label decoding, DNS response iteration, and cache management within the async DNS module of libwebsockets. It includes functions for parsing DNS labels, iterating over DNS response packets to extract address records, handling CNAME recursion, estimating and storing DNS query results, and managing DNS cache entries.", "external_files": ["private-lib-core.h", "private-lib-async-dns.h"], "external_methods": ["lws_ser_ru16be", "lws_ser_ru32be", "lws_callback_on_writable", "lws_malloc", "lws_free", "lws_write_numeric_address", "lws_dll2_add_head", "lws_now_usecs", "lws_sul_schedule", "lws_adns_get_query", "lws_adns_cache_destroy", "lws_adns_q_destroy"], "published": [], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "int lws_adns_parse_label(const uint8_t * pkt,int len,const uint8_t * ls,int budget,char ** dest,size_t dl)", "description": "Parses a DNS label from a packet, handling compression pointers, and copies the label into the destination buffer, returning the number of chars used in the label or -1 on failure.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int lws_adns_iterate(lws_adns_q_t * q,const uint8_t * pkt,int len,const char * expname,lws_async_dns_find_t cb,void * opaque)", "description": "Iterates through DNS response packets, calling a callback function for each matching address record (A or AAAA), handling recursion for CNAMEs, and returning status codes indicating success, failure, or recursion.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int lws_async_dns_estimate(const char * name,void * opaque,uint32_t ttl,adns_query_type_t type,const uint8_t * payload)", "description": "Estimates the size needed for DNS results (A/AAAA records) for a given hostname and appends it to an accumulator.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int lws_async_dns_store(const char * name,void * opaque,uint32_t ttl,adns_query_type_t type,const uint8_t * paylo